# Visual regression baselines are platform-specific (win32/linux/darwin).
# CI generates and caches its own (see .github/workflows/playwright.yml);
# these stay local-only so a Windows-generated baseline never gets pushed
# and compared against on Linux CI.
tests/**/*-snapshots/
